<title>USA: Comforce Corp acquires Azatar.</title>
<headline>Comforce Corp acquires Azatar.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comforce Corp said on Friday it completed the previously announced acquisition of Azatar Computer Systems Inc, a privately owned company.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Azatar, based in Rochester, New York, deals in information technology consulting to leading Fortune 500 companies in the U.S. Its current annualized revenue was estimated at $8 million.</p>
<p>Comforce provides staffing, consulting and outscoring solutions for telecommunications, information technology and technical market sectors worldwide.</p>
